# Copy to `.env` or `.env.local` in project root (Next.js loads both).
# 이 프로젝트는 **texture 결합** 파이프라인만 사용합니다.
# (표지 원본 + texture_prompt → Comfy Reference/텍스처 결합 → Save Image)

# =============================================================================
# OpenAI — 한글 텍스처 입력 → 영어 texture_prompt
# POST /api/refine  { "prompt": "나무", "purpose": "texture" }
# =============================================================================
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# =============================================================================
# RunPod Serverless — ComfyUI texture worker Endpoint
# RunPod Console → Settings → API Keys
# RunPod Console → Serverless → Endpoints → (생성한 Endpoint) → Endpoint ID
# =============================================================================
RUNPOD_API_KEY=
RUNPOD_ENDPOINT_ID=

# =============================================================================
# 이미지 업로드 (필수): S3 호환 (AWS S3 / Cloudflare R2)
# RunPod 워커는 data URL을 못 읽기 때문에, 먼저 업로드 후 HTTPS URL을 workflow에 주입합니다.
# =============================================================================
# 예) Cloudflare R2:
# S3_ENDPOINT=https://<ACCOUNT_ID>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
# S3_REGION=auto
# S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
# S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
# S3_BUCKET=<bucket>
# S3_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://<public-domain-or-r2-public-url>/<bucket>
S3_ENDPOINT=
S3_REGION=auto
S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
S3_BUCKET=
S3_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=

# =============================================================================
# RunPod input 전송 방식
# =============================================================================
# 기본값 (unset / 1 / true): prompt-only — worker handler가 workflow를 처리
# Next.js → POST /api/runpod/run → RunPod input 예시:
#
# {
#   "mode": "texture",
#   "texture_prompt": "wood grain, oak surface",
#   "image": "data:image/png;base64,...",
#   "image_name": "1976_cover.png"
# }
#
# material / texture_map / prompt 필드는 이 앱에서 보내지 않습니다.
#
# RUNPOD_INPUT_PROMPT_ONLY=1

# 0 / false 로 설정하면 repo의 Comfy API JSON을 패치해 workflow 필드도 함께 전송
# RUNPOD_INPUT_PROMPT_ONLY=0

# =============================================================================
# Comfy API export (RUNPOD_INPUT_PROMPT_ONLY=0 일 때만)
# =============================================================================
# Pod ComfyUI → Workflow → Save (API Format) → workflows/ 에 저장
# lib/comfy/pipeline.js 의 NODE_MAP id를 export 노드 id와 맞출 것
# COMFY_WORKFLOW_FILE=workflows/cover-pipeline.json

# =============================================================================
# 배포 후 확인 순서 (RunPod Serverless)
# =============================================================================
# 1. Pod ComfyUI workflow export → ComfyUI-to-API → GitHub → Serverless Endpoint
# 2. 위 RUNPOD_* 값을 채운 뒤 `yarn dev`
# 3. RunPod 콘솔에서 input.mode=texture 로 호출 테스트
# 4. 웹: 표지 선택 → 텍스처 입력 → 번역 → Generate
#
# 자세한 계약: docs/comfy-pipeline.md
